\f0\b\fs32 \cf0 Install QuickTime!
\f1\b0 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa320\ql\qnatural
\cf0 To use MPEG Streamclip in Windows XP, you have to download and install QuickTime, using one of the following installers (but NOT both!):\
- Apple QuickTime 7 free player (http://www.apple.com/quicktime/download/win.html)\
- KL QuickTime Alternative 1.61 or higher (http://www.codecguide.com/download_qt.htm)\
For DivX playback and encoding you have to install 3ivx (http://www.3ivx.com/) and make sure you have Windows Media Player 10 or higher.\
MPEG Streamclip is expected to be compatible with Windows Vista. You can also use MPEG Streamclip in Windows 2000 and in Linux with WINE, but results are not guaranteed.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa320\qc

\f0\b \cf0 Which QuickTime installer do I have to choose?\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa320\ql\qnatural

\f1\b0 \cf0 Apple QuickTime 7 is the official distribution of QuickTime. This free installer is recommended, however it is a very large file (more than 20 MB) and it does not include MPEG-2 decoding (you have to buy the MPEG-2 playback component separately from Apple, for $19.99).\
KL QuickTime Alternative is a free unofficial distribution of QuickTime. It has a quite smaller installer (less than 15 MB) and includes MPEG-2 decoding in the "Extra QuickTime plugins". When you install it, be sure to enable the checkbox "Extra QuickTime plugins", otherwise the MPEG-2 decoder will not be installed.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa320\qc

\f0\b \cf0 I have Apple iTunes or Apple QuickTime already installed, can I use QuickTime Alternative?\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa320\ql\qnatural

\f1\b0 \cf0 You can replace Apple QuickTime with QuickTime Alternative without causing problems to iTunes. Just start the QuickTime Alternative installer, and choose to uninstall Apple QuickTime before installing QuickTime Alternative.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa320\qc

\f0\b \cf0 MPEG Streamclip shows a green screen and freezes. What should I do?\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa320\ql\qnatural

\f1\b0 \cf0 This may happen with some graphic cards (nVidia FX 5200/5500). In this case, go to your control panel, open QuickTime settings, select "Advanced" and, in\'caVideo settings, disable DirectDraw acceleration. Please do not disable DirectDraw, but only\'caDirectDraw acceleration;\'cakeep DirectDraw enabled or MPEG Streamclip will not display the player.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa320\qc

\f0\b \cf0 Read the User's Guide!
\f1\b0 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa320\ql\qnatural
\cf0 The MPEG Streamclip Guide is provided in two formats (PDF ad RTF) with identical content. It describes the most important functions of MPEG Streamclip.\
Italian users will find a translated guide (RTF only) in the "International" folder.\
